   was landing at exactly 2, with zero variance across 15 sampled
   instances each (100%). Traced the exact mechanism: InternetEdge_WAFs_1
   (entry node) gets a Container_EnvVars credential-leak vuln whose target
   list is picked from an UNRESTRICTED "all nodes" pool (since WAFs_1
   doesn't match any attack_flow source_pattern), which includes goal
   nodes directly.

2. First fix attempt (this session, EARLIER, already reverted before this
   commit): excluded goals from SolvabilityPostProcessor's fallback pool
